            If your budget permits, <strong>insist on LiFePO4 Lithium (48V architecture)</strong> (such as the <a href="/equipment/felicity-solar-5kwh-lithium-battery" class="text-solar-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Felicity 5kWh 48V Lithium</a>). If budget constraints mandate lead-acid, choose AGM "Dry Cell" for indoor flats or Tall Tubular (like the <a href="/equipment/luminous-220ah-tubular-battery" class="text-solar-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Luminous 220Ah</a>) for ventilated exterior spaces, but budget for replacement every 18 to 24 months. Compare true generation costs in our <a href="/nigeria-lcoe-solar-vs-fuel-cost-index" class="text-solar-600 font-semibold hover:underline">2026 Nigerian LCOE Cost Index</a>.
          </p>
