            <li><strong>Formal Closed-Loop Lead-Acid Recycling:</strong> Establish regulated national take-back schemes for spent tubular and AGM batteries to eliminate toxic informal smelting and lead contamination in Nigerian communities.</li>
            <li><strong>Fiscal Incentives for Raw Lithium Cells:</strong> Reduce import tariffs on Tier-1 LiFePO4 cells to 0% to incentivize local battery assembly, pack building, and green job creation across Nigerian industrial clusters.</li>
          </ul>
